      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "5. Heard the submissions advanced on behalf of the parties and perused the case diary.\n6."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cadcb897685643ab9265214ae8000b86_39",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On perusal of case diary, it reveals that on an unfateful day, the aforesaid incident took place and resultantly many persons lost their lives and many other sustained injuries and also suffered permanent disability for all life to come."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a9b16659b20646d0a2f88bada2ae48f9_40",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The allegations so levelled against the applicant and other co-accused persons reveal commission of offence by them under the aforesaid sections."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d88d59fb533d4a5889bd6eb457ca053b_41",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There are specific allegations against the accused persons and their respective role is also mentioned in the statements of the witnesses recorded under Section 164 of Cr.P.C."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9734f62814294f16be197eb5d03d9ddc_42",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Witness Sharad Marskole has mentioned the name of accused persons in Paragraphs 2 and 8."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "05166c1d5b90466b8992228b2cebf173_43",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Simultaneously, witness Tufan Singh Ganjam and Sandeep Bamne also implicated the accused persons."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a19a86f6048e4d7c8259df770afcc9a6_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The statement of 5 MCRC-22118-2024 witness Sandeep Bamner clarifies that earlier Rajesh Agrawal, Somesh Agrawal,\nPradeep Agrawal and Aayush Agrawal used to work together but subsequently, three different sheds were constructed in the same f"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7ca3b763b74844c7b1b5367ae6acb279_45",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The role of accused Rafiq is also evident from the statement of witnesses Sheikh Firoze, Rukhsar Bano and Mangilal Saini."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "76562d31dceb418eb3c01c27b6abf029_46",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "7. In the present case, against accused Rajesh Agrawal in past as well offence of similar nature were registered and he was convicted as well."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "14a1859f9bf54dbe8d3c2330afdbdfc3_47",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Simultaneously in respect of accused Pradeep Goyal, similar cases were registered, therefore, prima facie they were in the knowledge that there action would result in untoward incident in future."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a7f9a95223084d31810916fe7b17730d_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, it cannot be said at this stage that no case under Section 304 of IPC is made out in view of past antecedents of the applicants/accused persons including the conviction under the provisions of Section 5, 6 of the Explosive Substa"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a46c0c4194dc4fe1b8147dd918befc2f_49",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "8. The medical report dated 18.6.2024 sent by the Medical Officer, Central Jail, Bhopal clearly reveals that the applicant is being treated at Government Hamidia Hospital where he is undergoing process of Dialysis."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3d85d4a749834d0c879a3fd5ab18abaf_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The report prima facie nowhere suggests any critical condition of the applicant 9."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9ad6b626506c451ba838a5d707e5f293_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thus, considering the overall facts and circumstances of the case, this Court is not inclined to release the applicant on bail."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7d017757f1ed41aeb10c9641899616d5_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n10. The judgments so relied upon by the counsel for the applicant are of no assistance in view of particular facts and circumstances of the case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "68f85f7e2ecc407e9588c588f3aa8519_53",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
